    {
      "id": 71720,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-30T04:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, here's the deal: If anything is labeled for younger than 13, it's classified as a toy (no matter what it actually is). If a thing is classified as a toy, it has to go through a specific set of testing that is both extensive and expensive.</p>\n<p>So SotM is for ages 13+.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>\n<p>(I.e., pretty much what Foote said.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As to all the other stuff, I don't have that list with me and don't have a way to go over it with them. I did ask about one thing I'll get posted in the appropriate place, though. (I asked about another but have already forgotten what it was - it's been a <em>really</em> long day…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"> )</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:50:58.356Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
